folders
/SourceMods         --- SourceMods shared by the FV configs (cam_aqua_fv, cam_land_fv, cam_mixed_fv)
/configs            --- model configurations: each config's own SourceMods, namelist files,
                        and (FV configs) a COMPONENTS list
install_sourcemods.sh  --- assembles an FV config's SourceMods into a case:
                        install_sourcemods.sh <config> $CASEROOT/SourceMods
/ccsm_utils_files   --- utility files to faciliate new compsets and machines, shared
/initial_files      --- shared collection of initial conditions files used by the model
/instructions       --- collection of instructions manuals
